    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 19.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he hine triewan wille, þæt he to ðære læne facn ne wiste, þæt he mot.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he wishes to clear himself [by oath] that he knew of no malice when he made the loan, he may do so.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he wishes to clear himself, [by swearing] he was cognisant of no criminal intention when he made the loan, he may do so.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he hine trywan wille, ðæt he to ðære fore ⁊ to ðære læne facn nyste, ðæt he mot.</ab>
      </div>
